#: src/main.ui:60
msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Mudelli tal-wiċċ"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots ta' wiċċek li Ubuntu Hello jitqabbel magħhom. Żomm mill-inqas "
"tnejn, irreġistrati f'dawl differenti."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Li juru mudelli salvati għal:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Hemm reġistrat mudell wieħed biss tal-wiċċ. In-nuċċali, bidla fix-xagħar tal-"
"wiċċ jew dawl differenti jibdlu kif il-kamera tara wiċċek, għalhekk mudell "
"wieħed jista' jfalli (pereżempju filgħaxija taħt il-lampi). Żid it-tieni "
"mudell bin-nuċċali jew mingħajru, bid-dehra l-oħra tiegħek, jew f'dawl "
"differenti biex il-ftuħ jibqa' affidabbli."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Żid it-tieni mudell"

#: src/main.ui:227
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Mudelli"

#: src/main.ui:261
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamera"

#: src/main.ui:276
msgid ""
"The camera Ubuntu Hello uses to look for your face, with a live preview."
msgstr "Il-kamera Ubuntu Hello tuża biex tfittex wiċċek, bi preview live."

#: src/main.ui:300
msgid "Camera ID:"
msgstr "ID tal-kamera:"

#: src/main.ui:315
msgid "Real resolution:"
msgstr "Riżoluzzjoni reali:"

#: src/main.ui:331
msgid "Used resolution:"
msgstr "Riżoluzzjoni użata:"

#: src/main.ui:347
msgid "Recorder:"
msgstr "Reġistratur:"

#: src/main.ui:393
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Vidjo"

#: src/main.ui:430 src/main.ui:583
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notifiki"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Notifika tad-desktop turi waqt li Ubuntu Hello tfittex wiċċek, imbagħad "
"tirrapporta r-riżultat. It-tentattivi falluti jibqgħu fil-lista tan-notifika."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Uri notifiki"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Karta waħda għal kull tentattiv ta' awtentikazzjoni tal-wiċċ, aġġornata mar-"
"riżultat."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Ħsejjes tan-notifika"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Iddoqq il-ħoss tas-sistema għal tentattiv rikonoxxut jew fallut."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Inkludi dijanjostiċi"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Żid il-mudell, iċ-ċertezza vs il-limitu, il-frejms, il-kamera u l-ħin għal "
"kull karta. Utli meta tirrapporta problema."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sigurtà"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Kemm irid jaqbel eżatt wiċċek, u jekk Ubuntu Hello jitolbokx tikkonferma li "
"verament qiegħed hemm."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Kemm għandha tkun stretta t-taqbila tal-wiċċ"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Mgħaġġel"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Ibbilanċjat"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Sikura"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Itlobni nbaxxi rasi biex nikkonferma"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Wara li wiċċek jaqbel, notifika titolbok tbaxxi rasek. Ritratt miżmum "
"quddiem il-kamera ma jistax ibaxxi rasu."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Awto-Unlock"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Attiva l-awtentikazzjoni tal-wiċċ biex il-keyring tal-login tiegħek jew "
"KWallet jinfetħu awtomatikament mal-login. Dan jaħżen il-password tiegħek "
"b'mod sigur: issiġillata fit-TPM meta jkun disponibbli, jew kriptata "
"b'AES-256-GCM b'ċavetta prinċipali li root biss jista' juża. L-"
"awtentikazzjoni tal-wiċċ tissettja PAM_AUTHTOK għal pam_gnome_keyring jew "
"pam_kwallet5, skont id-desktop tiegħek."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Status kurrenti:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Tiċċekkja..."

#: src/main.ui:834
msgid "Enable Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Ippermetti l-Awto-Unlock"

#: src/main.ui:862
msgid "Keyring"
msgstr "Ċurkett taċ-ċwievet"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "Lingwa tal-wiri"

#: src/main.ui:913
msgid "Automatic follows the system language. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Awtomatiku jsegwi l-lingwa tas-sistema. Il-bidliet japplikaw mill-ewwel."

#: src/main.ui:936 src/main.ui:956
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Lingwa"

#: src/main.ui:977
msgid "Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/main.ui:990
msgid "Facial authentication for Linux"
msgstr "Awtentikazzjoni tal-wiċċ għal Linux"

#: src/main.ui:999
msgid "Version unknown"
msgstr "Verżjoni mhux magħrufa"

#: src/main.ui:1013
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Open GitHub link</a> "
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Iftaħ il-link ta' "
"GitHub</a> "

#: src/main.ui:1020
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Report a problem "
"or suggest a feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Irrapporta "
"problema jew tissuġġerixxi karatteristika</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Dwar"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Merħba għal Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Is-setup sar!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Aħna lesti! Ubuntu Hello issa hija attiva fuq dan il-kompjuter. Ipprova "
"agħmel xi ħaġa li normalment ikollok ittajpja l-password tiegħek biex "
"tawtentika, bħal tmexxi kmand b'sudo. Jekk ippermettit il-ftuħ awtomatiku "
"taċ-ċwievet, iċ-ċwievet tal-login tiegħek jew KWallet jinfetaħ ukoll "
"awtomatikament mal-login.\n"
"\n"
"Tista' tiftaħ il-Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratur aktar tard biex tibdel settings "
"aktar avvanzati jew iżżid mudelli addizzjonali. Agħfas Finish hawn taħt biex "
"tagħlaq din it-tieqa u tiftaħ il-Konfiguratur Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "It-twaqqif ta' politika ta' ċertezza"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Minħabba bidliet fl-angoli, id-distanza, u fatturi oħra taqbila tal-wiċċ "
"qatt ma hija eżattament l-istess bħall-mudell tal-wiċċ maħżun. F'din il-"
"paġna tista' tissettja kemm għandha tkun stretta Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"It-taqbila l-aktar permissiva u l-aktar mgħaġġla biex iddaħħlek. Agħżel din "
"jekk il-konvenjenza tiswa aktar mis-strettezza."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Taqbila stretta li xorta waħda ddaħħlek malajr. Jista' jkun li ma tagħrfekx "
"minn angolu qawwi jew minn iktar 'il bogħod."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"It-taqbila l-aktar stretta, mingħajr pass żejjed meta tidħol. Rakkomandata."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Aqbeż għalissa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Tista' żżid aktar mudelli tal-wiċċ aktar tard mis-Settings jew bi: sudo "
"ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Konfigurazzjoni tal-webcam"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "L-emittent infra-aħmar qed iteptep?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Ħares lejn il-kamera li għażilt: kamera infrared turi dawl żgħir li jteptep "
"waqt li Ubuntu Hello jittestjaha. Dan jgħidilna jekk tistax tara wiċċek fid-"
"dlam."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Iva, itteptep"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Le, xejn ma jteptep"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello se tfittex is-sistema tiegħek awtomatikament għal kwalunkwe "
"kameras disponibbli, għalhekk kun żgur li l-webcam tiegħek hija konnessa. "
"Wara l-iskoperta se tintwera lista ta' webcams li jistgħu jintużaw. Agħżel "
"dik li trid tuża u kklikkja Li jmiss."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Tittestja l-webcams tiegħek, jekk jogħġbok stenna..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Tniżżil ta' fajls tad-dejta"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello jeħtieġ tliet settijiet ta' dejta ta' rikonoxximent tal-wiċċ "
"imħarrġa minn qabel biex ikunu jistgħu jagħrfuk, li se jitniżżlu issa. Tista "
"'tara l-progress tat-tniżżil hawn taħt."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Nibda niżżel..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Merħba għal Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verżjoni"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Dan l-wizard se jimxik permezz tal-proċess tas-setup u awtomatikament "
"tikkonfigura Ubuntu Hello għalik. Agħfas li jmiss biex tkompli."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello jista’ awtomatikament jiftaħ iċ-ċwievet tal-login tiegħek jew "
"KWallet billi juża l-awtentikazzjoni tal-wiċċ, u jipprevjeni l-prompts tal-"
"password wara li tidħol."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Ippermetti l-ftuħ awtomatiku taċ-ċwievet/KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Ikkonferma l-password"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Lura"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Temm is-setup"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Li jmiss"

